<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Miami to New York Trip 2026</title>
<style>
body{
    margin:0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background:#0b1f3a;
    color:white;
}
header{
    text-align:center;
    padding:60px 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff512f, #1e90ff);
}
h1{
    font-size:40px;
    margin:0;
}
h2{
    margin-top:10px;
    font-weight:300;
}
.section{
    padding:40px 20px;
    max-width:1000px;
    margin:auto;
}
.card{
    background:#132a4a;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:15px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
    box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}
img{
    width:100%;
    border-radius:15px;
    margin-top:10px;
}
.day-title{
    color:#ffcc70;
    font-size:22px;
}
.small{
    opacity:0.8;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <h1>Miami → New York Road Trip</h1>
    <h2>Sukkot 2026 ✈️🚗</h2>
</header>
<div class="section">
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Flight Day ✈️</div>
    <p class="small">Tel Aviv → Miami</p>
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?w=1000">
    <p>We land in Miami and begin our adventure 🌴</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Day 1 - Miami Arrival 🌴</div>
    <p>• Coffee near the hotel<br>
    • Rest at the hotel<br>
    • Walk around the city<br>
    • Shopping<br>
    • Fancy dinner at a top restaurant</p>
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506966953602-c20cc11f75e3?w=1000">
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Day 2 - Miami Chill Day 🌊</div>
    <p>• Beach morning<br>
    • City exploring<br>
    • Cocktails in the afternoon<br>
    • Shopping<br>
    • Dinner & rest before the road trip</p>
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500375592092-40eb2168fd21?w=1000">
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Day 3 - Start the Road Trip 🚗</div>
    <p>Miami → Orlando</p>
    <p>• Start driving north<br>
    • Stop in Orlando<br>
    • Dinner & sleep</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Day 4 - Savannah 🏙️</div>
    <p>• Drive to Savannah<br>
    • Old town walk<br>
    • Riverfront dinner</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Day 5 - Charleston 🌊</div>
    <p>• Historic streets<br>
    • Beach sunset<br>
    • Southern food night</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Day 6 - Outer Banks 🏖️</div>
    <p>• Coastal drive<br>
    • Lighthouse visit<br>
    • Relaxing day</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Day 7 - Washington D.C. 🇺🇸</div>
    <p>• White House area<br>
    • Museums<br>
    • Night walk in the city</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Day 8 - Philadelphia 🧀</div>
    <p>• Old city tour<br>
    • Cheesesteak stop<br>
    • Evening drive</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Day 9 - New Jersey Stop 🚗</div>
    <p>• Chill day near NYC<br>
    • Rest before arrival</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Day 10 - New York City 🗽</div>
    <p>• Times Square<br>
    • Central Park<br>
    • Shopping & celebration</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
    <div class="day-title">Final Surprise 🎉</div>
    <p>We made it from Miami to New York together ❤️</p>
    <p>Best trip ever.</p>
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1496588152823-86ff7695e68f?w=1000">
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
